{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Dive into a world of nostalgia and epic battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FANTASY HEARTS is a modern take on a classic: an old-school atmosphere of tactical RPGs, hardcore turn-based battles, and true fantasy magic. If you\u2019ve ever been a fan of Final Fantasy Tactics, Heroes of Might and Magic, Eador, or Disciples, you\u2019ll feel right at home here.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/018dc30f40db4a6f3b62e3df61dd6f8d.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/018dc30f40db4a6f3b62e3df61dd6f8d.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/018dc30f40db4a6f3b62e3df61dd6f8d.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 UPDATED CLASSIC OF THE GENRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 PvP battles<br>\u2714 PvE battles<br>\u2714 Hex field<br>\u2714 Fantasy characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/92b8917032c1c41bf279a3ccb5c53420.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=800 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/92b8917032c1c41bf279a3ccb5c53420.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/92b8917032c1c41bf279a3ccb5c53420.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>FANTASY HEARTS</strong> is inhabited by different races. In our universe, humans, beasts, elves, goblins, and the undead often fight side by side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff9 UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, plan your tactics, combine skills, and adapt to every battle. The outcome depends entirely on choosing the right heroes. You can recruit the following into your squad:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even raise the dead <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 FIGHT THE BEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of 4\u20135 fighters, test your strategies in training, and then challenge other players in the arena. Each battle is a new test where not only strength matters, but also your ability to adapt to the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f CUSTOMIZE YOUR ARMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is more than just scenery. Terrain, cover, and tactical positioning can be the key to victory. Plan every move carefully \u2014 and you will be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/dfcb4661785b2e3477a104afba4278c5.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/dfcb4661785b2e3477a104afba4278c5.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/dfcb4661785b2e3477a104afba4278c5.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d GUILDS, EVENTS, COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own guild or join an existing one, take part in time-limited events, complete tavern quests, hire mercenaries, and chat with other players in a cozy old-school atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/17ef0df867f6b85f5f1399f83393efa8.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/17ef0df867f6b85f5f1399f83393efa8.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/17ef0df867f6b85f5f1399f83393efa8.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Fantasy Hearts awaits its hero. Join now \u2014 and write your own legend.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3258090?t=1755211674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3258090?t=1755211674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/9db4163823b808206d26bdcfba97233bc8ed2597/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755211674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/9db4163823b808206d26bdcfba97233bc8ed2597/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755211674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Dive into a world of nostalgia and epic battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FANTASY HEARTS is a modern take on a classic: an old-school atmosphere of tactical RPGs, hardcore turn-based battles, and true fantasy magic. If you\u2019ve ever been a fan of Final Fantasy Tactics, Heroes of Might and Magic, Eador, or Disciples, you\u2019ll feel right at home here.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/018dc30f40db4a6f3b62e3df61dd6f8d.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/018dc30f40db4a6f3b62e3df61dd6f8d.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/018dc30f40db4a6f3b62e3df61dd6f8d.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 UPDATED CLASSIC OF THE GENRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 PvP battles<br>\u2714 PvE battles<br>\u2714 Hex field<br>\u2714 Fantasy characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/92b8917032c1c41bf279a3ccb5c53420.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=800 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/92b8917032c1c41bf279a3ccb5c53420.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/92b8917032c1c41bf279a3ccb5c53420.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>FANTASY HEARTS</strong> is inhabited by different races. In our universe, humans, beasts, elves, goblins, and the undead often fight side by side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff9 UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, plan your tactics, combine skills, and adapt to every battle. The outcome depends entirely on choosing the right heroes. You can recruit the following into your squad:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even raise the dead <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/7f97dc5cbba34072189fa2e6c01ec962.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 FIGHT THE BEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of 4\u20135 fighters, test your strategies in training, and then challenge other players in the arena. Each battle is a new test where not only strength matters, but also your ability to adapt to the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/4a312118ece2f5747460d2da2628bdc9.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f CUSTOMIZE YOUR ARMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is more than just scenery. Terrain, cover, and tactical positioning can be the key to victory. Plan every move carefully \u2014 and you will be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/dfcb4661785b2e3477a104afba4278c5.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/dfcb4661785b2e3477a104afba4278c5.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/dfcb4661785b2e3477a104afba4278c5.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d GUILDS, EVENTS, COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own guild or join an existing one, take part in time-limited events, complete tavern quests, hire mercenaries, and chat with other players in a cozy old-school atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/17ef0df867f6b85f5f1399f83393efa8.poster.avif?t=1755211674\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/17ef0df867f6b85f5f1399f83393efa8.webm?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/extras/17ef0df867f6b85f5f1399f83393efa8.mp4?t=1755211674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Fantasy Hearts awaits its hero. Join now \u2014 and write your own legend.</p>","developers":["Dreamcraft Studio"],"dlc":[3505290,3505300],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258090/header.jpg?t=1755211674","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3258090/802875/9587f3c4469e12471e65580354